  <div id="new-world">
    <h1 class="sec-title">New World</h1>
    <div class="nw-description">
      <p><strong>A massive new continent awaits you.</strong></p>
      <p>Cut off from the rest of the world for centuries, Northern Arun is a land of savage jungles, colossal ruins, and the undiscovered homeland of the barakas.</p>
      <p>Explore this new world, meet new allies, battle new enemies, and free the land from their tyranny.</p>
      <p><strong>A New Evil Awaits…</strong></p>
      <p>Battle through the Imperial Archdevan Army and their monstrous abominations as you prepare to confront the vile shadow lord Dakuryon.</p>
    </div>
