  <div id="guilds">
    <h1 class="sec-title">Guilds</h1>
    <div class="guild-description">
      <% if @prelaunch %>
      <h3>Join the Crusade for the best of PvE, PvP, and guild-vs.-guild&mdash;the competition starts on 2.24.15!</h3>
      <% else %>
      <h3>Join the Crusade for the best of PvE, PvP, and guild-vs.-guild competition—and change the way you play TERA forever!</h3>
      <% end %>
      <p>We&rsquo;re improving <em>TERA</em>&rsquo;s guild system with a game-changing competitive structure that literally takes players where they’ve never gone before. Customizable, floating Skycastle housing waits for the best of the best to claim them and fly their guild banners where the whole world can see.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="guild-features">
      <li class="challenger">
        <h3>Challenger League</h3>
        <p>Your guild&rsquo;s proven ability to master dungeons is finally paying off! During each month-long crusade, guilds in the Challenger League take on <em>TERA</em>&rsquo;s toughest bosses, earning rewards for working together as a team. Can you and your friends bring home the highest scores, and earn yourselves a Skycastle?</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cutthroat">
        <h3>Cutthroat League</h3>
        <p>Fight your way to the top in <em>TERA</em>&rsquo;s acclaimed PvP battlegrounds, adding your personal successes to your guild&rsquo;s efforts.  And in the rest of the world, take on up to 10 other guilds at once, wagering your accumulated Fame as proof of your guild&rsquo;s indomitable might!</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
