      <p>Your journey will not only take you through the brand new continent of Northern Arun, but will level you up to 65. You'll upgrade skills and glyphs and gain a host of brand-new powerful skills. Plus a new tier of powerful weapons and armor will help you survive the new challenges waiting for you in the archdevan fortress.</p>
