  <div id="coliseum">
    <h1 class="sec-title">The Coliseum</h1>
    <h2 class="skyring-title">Champion's Skyring Mark V</h2>
    <div class="skyring-desc">
      <% if @prelaunch %>
      <h3>NEW 5-Man PVP Battleground&mdash;Coming 2.24.15</h3>
      <% else %>
      <h3>NEW 5-Man PVP Battleground</h3>
      <% end %>
      <p>Champions&rsquo; Skyring was already a true test of PvP skill, but in the new 5-on-5 mode only the strong will survive. Gather your team and prepare yourselves for a fight! This kill-or-be-killed battleground will put your teamwork, reflexes, and tactics to the ultimate test.</p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="coliseum-title">Coliseum</h2>
    <div class="coliseum-desc">
      <h3>Where PvE &amp; PvP Clash</h3>
      <p>Welcome to the Coliseum, a fast-paced new battleground mode where two teams race each other to defeat waves of mobs and BAMs in a test of skill, strategy, and teamwork!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="enhancements">
    <div class="enhance-desc">
      <h3>An Improved Experience</h3>
      <p>We’ve improved your playing experience whether you’re on quests or off. Streamlined quest lines keep you focused on that level cap. It’s never been faster or easier to enhance your gear, and it certainly will reduce the clutter in your packs or bank.</p> 
    </div>
    <div class="enhance-features clearfix">
      <div class="enchant">
        <div class="enh-screen"></div>
        <h3>Simplified Enchanting</h3>
        <p>Feedstock plus alkahest equals pluses to your gear! The better the gear you dismantle, the more feedstock you get! You can dismantle gear anywhere, so no more overloaded packs!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="crystals">
        <div class="enh-screen"></div>
        <h3>Fuse Crystals</h3>
        <p>Crystals serve you best in your gear, not in your pack! Now you can fuse those unhelpful crystals into new crystals with other effects, higher-ranked crystals, or even superb crystals which give two effects and never break!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="quest-ui">
        <div class="enh-screen"></div>
        <h3>New Quest UI</h3>
        <p>The new quest interface for levels 60–65 offers a streamlined quest line, dailies, and bonus rewards for logging in. Plus now you can teleport right to the action, find a group, or turn in your quests...wherever you may be!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
